  "symmetry": {
    "findings": [
      "Tokke G1/G2 generator dictionaries are identical and share penstock1; G3/G4 are identical and share penstock2. Cross-pair generator dictionaries differ by penstock. Shared-penstock losses make all-four interchangeable-unit assumptions inappropriate.",
      "Vinje unit dictionaries differ only by penstock number; each associated penstock loss coefficient equals0.001. This supports an approximate structural symmetry, not proof of identical solver tie-breaking.",
      "Tokke G1<G2 violations are0 in2021 and7 in2022; G3<G4 violations are165 and90. Most previously reported adjacent Tokke ordering violations are G2/G3 across penstocks,4949 and3303.",
      "Vinje unit-number priority is strong but not absolute. Hard sorting all units would change some valid exceptions.",
      "Soft pairwise ordering or count/allocation structure is a defensible future experiment. Current errors are concentrated in single-generator plants, so this does not directly explain the whole remaining gap."
    ],
