    "interpretation": "Relative cycle cost per max MW is58.37 for Haukeli,11.06 for Hogga,7.58 for Lio and3.98 for each Tokke unit, in consistent YAML monetary units per MW. This illustrates why small units may need longer profitable intervals; it is not an exact profit threshold because production, hydraulic value and initial state differ.",
